@startuml 实验通信框架业务流程图

skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam defaultFontName "微软雅黑"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam roundCorner 15
skinparam ArrowColor #3498DB
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2E86C1
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #D6EAF8
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #AED6F1
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2874A6
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2874A6
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #D6EAF8
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FCF3CF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F1C40F
skinparam TitleFontSize 20
skinparam TitleFontColor #2C3E50
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EAEDED
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #95A5A6

title 实验通信框架业务流程图

participant "实验客户端程序" as Client
participant "设备管理器" as DeviceManager
participant "实验管理器" as ExperimentManager
participant "实验实例" as Experiment
participant "实验参数" as ExperimentParameter
participant "实验结果" as ExperimentResult
participant "TCP网络连接" as Connection
participant "主机服务器" as Server

== 初始化阶段 ==

Client -> DeviceManager: 创建设备管理器
activate DeviceManager

DeviceManager->Connection: 创建TCP网络连接
activate Connection
Connection -> Server: 建立TCP连接
activate Server
Server --> Connection: 连接成功
Connection --> DeviceManager: 连接成功并返回设备参数
DeviceManager -> DeviceManager: 解析并保存设备参数

DeviceManager -> ExperimentManager: 创建实验管理器
activate ExperimentManager

par 并行接收设备参数
    Server -> Connection: 发送设备参数
    Connection -> DeviceManager: 接收设备参数
    DeviceManager -> DeviceManager: 解析并保存设备参数
end

== 实验初始化阶段 ==

Client -> ExperimentManager: 请求注册实验实例
Client -> ExperimentManager: 请求注册实验参数

ExperimentManager -> Experiment: 创建实验实例
ExperimentManager -> ExperimentParameter: 创建实验参数并输入参数
ExperimentParameter -> ExperimentParameter: 校验参数是否合法
ExperimentParameter -> Experiment: 设置实验参数

Client -> ExperimentManager: 请求开始实验并阻塞命令窗口

== 实验执行阶段 ==

Experiment -> ExperimentManager: 提取实验json数据
ExperimentManager -> DeviceManager: 发送实验参数
DeviceManager -> Connection: 发送参数数据
Connection -> Server: 发送参数数据

note right of Server
  服务器开始实验
end note

Server --> Connection: 确认接收
Connection -> DeviceManager: 转发实验数据
DeviceManager -> ExperimentManager: 转发实验数据
ExperimentManager -> Experiment: 转发实验数据
Experiment -> Experiment: 等待数据

loop 多个实验步骤
    Server -> Server: 处理单步数据完成

    Server -> Connection: 返回单步数据
    Connection -> DeviceManager: 接收单步实验数据
    DeviceManager -> DeviceManager: 解析数据

    alt 设备数据
        DeviceManager -> DeviceManager: 保存设备数据
    else 实验数据
        DeviceManager -> ExperimentManager: 转发实验数据
    end

    ExperimentManager -> Experiment: 获取实验数据并处理
    Experiment -> Experiment: 处理单个步骤信息
    Experiment -> Experiment: 等待下一个步骤
end

note right of Server
    服务器实验完成
end note

Server -> Connection: 发送实验完成信息和参数
Connection -> DeviceManager: 接收实验完成信息和参数
DeviceManager -> ExperimentManager: 转发实验完成信息和参数
ExperimentManager -> Experiment: 获取实验完成信息和参数
Experiment -> Experiment: 处理实验完成信息

== 结束阶段 ==
Experiment -> ExperimentManager: 实验完成
ExperimentManager -> Experiment: 保存结果并注销实验实例
ExperimentManager -> ExperimentResult: 保存结果
deactivate Experiment
activate ExperimentResult
ExperimentResult -> Client: 返回结果信息
deactivate ExperimentResult

Client -> DeviceManager: 断开连接
DeviceManager -> ExperimentManager: 注销实验管理器
deactivate ExperimentManager

DeviceManager -> Connection: 请求断开连接
Connection -> Server: 断开连接
Server -> Connection: 确认断开
deactivate Server
Connection -> DeviceManager: 断开连接成功
deactivate Connection
deactivate DeviceManager
deactivate Client

@enduml 